    "detailed_description": "SIZIF is 3D endless runner in a glowing and kind of abstract environment wich was originally designed to pass time while waiting on a computer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhile the sphere will be rolling forward by itself and increase it speed, you'll have to moove sideway and jump to avoid osbtacles.<br />\r\nYou'll get the possibility to take some risks and charge bonuses during a run. It could make your run easier for a small amount of time with a double jump for example or double the score you generate.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring a run you generate a score. Your best score is automatically upload at the end of the run. <br />\r\nYou could see it on 2 leaderboard, one with only your contact and a global leaderboard.",
    "about_the_game": "SIZIF is 3D endless runner in a glowing and kind of abstract environment wich was originally designed to pass time while waiting on a computer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhile the sphere will be rolling forward by itself and increase it speed, you'll have to moove sideway and jump to avoid osbtacles.<br />\r\nYou'll get the possibility to take some risks and charge bonuses during a run. It could make your run easier for a small amount of time with a double jump for example or double the score you generate.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring a run you generate a score. Your best score is automatically upload at the end of the run. <br />\r\nYou could see it on 2 leaderboard, one with only your contact and a global leaderboard.",
    "short_description": "SIZIF is a 3D endless runner where you simply control a ball and avoid obstacles to generate score for the longest time possible and climb the leaderboard. During a game you can unlock bonuses to either make your run easier or generate more score.",
